// Portable monitor config — works on ANY machine out of the box.
//
// This file intentionally has NO explicit output blocks. Niri then
// auto-detects every connected monitor and uses its preferred mode at native
// resolution, scale 1, arranged left-to-right. This is what makes a clone of
// this repo usable on a different PC with different displays.
//
// To recreate this machine's exact layout (DP-2 @1440p primary + HDMI-A-1
// @1080p secondary with custom positions/scales), the installer detects both
// outputs and swaps this file for monitor.lotus.kdl automatically. See
// install-scripts/06-dotfiles.sh. You can also copy it manually:
//   cp ~/.config/niri/monitor.lotus.kdl ~/.config/niri/monitor.kdl
